# Read combo — command measurement plus current-source explanation profile
#
# Regression target: command output can be principal evidence without fake
# source file:line citations, but mixed requests may still need current source
# to explain how command measurements are represented downstream.
ID="read_combo_command_current_source_explanation"
NAME="read combo — command measurement plus current source explanation profile"
QUESTION="请递归统计 internal/tool 整个目录树中的非测试 Go 文件数量（包含所有子目录，不是仅直属文件），再结合当前源码解释命令测量结果如何作为 command_measurement 证据进入答案链路；请说明统计值、递归口径、当前源码依据和边界。"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="**值：**"
EXPECT_DYNAMIC_SCALARS="tool_non_test_go_recursive"
EXPECT_DYNAMIC_SCALAR_COMMAND_TOOL_NON_TEST_GO_RECURSIVE="find internal/tool -type f -name '*.go' ! -name '*_test.go' -print | LC_ALL=C wc -l | tr -d '[:space:]'"
EXPECT_DYNAMIC_SCALAR_DATA_SCOPE_TOOL_NON_TEST_GO_RECURSIVE="repo_checkout:internal/tool;recursion=recursive;include=*.go;exclude=*_test.go"
EXPECT_DYNAMIC_SCALAR_SURFACE_TOOL_NON_TEST_GO_RECURSIVE="primary_text"
EXPECT_DYNAMIC_SCALAR_BINDING_REGEX_TOOL_NON_TEST_GO_RECURSIVE="((internal/tool|非测试|Go 文件|递归)[^0-9]{0,160}(^|[^0-9]){{VALUE}}([^0-9]|$))|((^|[^0-9]){{VALUE}}([^0-9]|$)[^0-9]{0,160}(internal/tool|非测试|Go 文件|递归))"
# 2026-05-30 false-negative repair: line 1 demanded the statistic
# vocabulary and the current-source vocabulary co-occur on ONE physical
# line (grep is line-based, `.` never crosses newlines). A verified-
# complete answer (count = 145 + a full command_measurement→current-
# source evidence-chain explanation + source anchors + boundary) split
# those two concepts across a heading ("源码依据（command_measurement
# 证据链路）") and a separate statistic line, so no single line carried
# both — a structural artifact of normal markdown, not a content miss.
# Decompose: line 1 now only asserts the statistic dimension is present;
# line 2 already enforces the command↔current-source binding (the
# load-bearing intent: command output represented as downstream
# current-source evidence). EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="**值：**" still blocks
# scalar compression, keeping the substantive bar intact.
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(internal/tool|非测试|Go 文件|统计|数量)
(命令|exec|command|measurement|统计值).*(源码|internal/|证据|边界)|(源码|internal/|证据|边界).*(命令|exec|command|measurement|统计值)"
